      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Backend policy \u2014\nsafety first<br>Illness:\ncritical; damage:\nhigh<br>Stockout +\npositive stock:\nconflict<br>Stockout +\nzero stock:\nreplenishment<br>Pricing:\nevidence + manager\napproval<br>Impact /\ninjection / ambiguity add\nreview<br>Collect missing\ninformation; invent no\nloss",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "RYlx_eE932FoNpM6RrgY0",
      "originalText": "6. Backend policy \u2014 safety first<br>Illness: critical; damage: high<br>Stockout + positive stock: conflict<br>Stockout + zero stock: replenishment<br>Pricing: evidence + manager approval<br>Impact / injection / ambiguity add review<br>Collect missing information; invent no loss",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
